#: of pybamm.expression_tree.symbol.Symbol:10
msgid ""
"dictionary of auxiliary domains over which the node is valid (empty "
"dictionary indicates no auxiliary domains). Keys can be \"secondary\", "
"\"tertiary\" or \"quaternary\". The symbol is broadcast over its auxiliary "
"domains. For example, a symbol might have domain \"negative particle\", "
"secondary domain \"separator\" and tertiary domain \"current "
"collector\" (`domain=\"negative particle\", "
"auxiliary_domains={\"secondary\": \"separator\", \"tertiary\": \"current "
"collector\"}`)."
msgstr ""

